# App-authored briefing, not from a tape. Grounded only in the public label in
# levels.json and the unverified secondary overview. No tape or manual in the
# library describes Focus 42. The solar-system, galaxy and I-There description
# is therefore presented as a map to test, never as an expected perception.

@segment     briefing-f42
@title       Focus 42 — I-There Cluster
@levels      F42
@verbosity   2
@protected   Focus 42, I-There
@duration    ~1m

say You are now in Focus 42.
pause 5
say No tape or manual in this library describes this level. The available map is a secondary overview of uncertain origin, so hold its description lightly.
pause 6
say That overview associates Focus 42 with exploring the solar system, our galaxy, and what it calls our I-There.
pause 8
say Treat those as coordinates to test, not sights or presences you are required to perceive.
pause 6
say Observe the actual scale, structure, or absence that is present for you, without forcing it to match the map.
pause 12
say Remember what you notice. Your attributed account may confirm, amend, or reject the available description.
pause 10
